  {
    "id": "KOK_event.3",
    "type": "country_event",
    "title": "A Gangster-Brotherly Deal?",
    "desc": "On this day, which was unusual for the entire Abu Khan domain, an urgent telegram arrived from [YGR.GetName]. On any ordinary, peaceful day, one would never expect to receive any diplomatic communications from any Russian warlord state. The few messages that crossed the border indicated the gradual consolidation of a menacing Russia, looming like a dangerous shadow over the Kazakh steppe.\n\nLocal russians understood only force, so all of Abu's followers and warriors knew that the stronger they were, the less likely they were to face a threat from their northern neighbor. But this time, it seemed, this message was an exception to the rule, written by [YGR.GetLeader] himself. So the document, upon receipt, went directly into the leader's hands without any intermediaries.\n\nAfter carefully reading the message, Khan was pleased with the material aid that was to be sent across the border in the coming days. It consisted of automatic weapons, equipment, medical supplies, and even hard-to-find artillery! Without a doubt, this would greatly help the lightly armed Kazakh bandits hasten the reunification of Kazakhstan. In addition, there was a secret protocol in this document - a mutual obligation to send volunteer troops to the other party should it find itself at war.\n\nHere, those closest to the leader had some concerns about allowing [YGR.GetLeader]'s regular and loyal troops to enter our territory. In the end, our states did not become direct allies, and our homelands were separated by other dangerous rivals who still had to be defeated. So, after discussions with his ministers, weighing all the prospects and taking into account the situation of his bandit units during the battles for the reunification of Kazakhstan, Abu Khan decided...",
    "picture": "GFX_yugra_cat",
    "is_superevent": false,
    "is_triggered_only": true,
    "fire_only_once": true,
    "trigger": {},
    "immediate": {
      "log": "[GetDateText]: [Root.GetName]: event KOK_event.3"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "name": "\"We're happy with their Thieves' Code - we'll spread their ideas throughout all of Kazakhstan!\"",
        "name_key": "KOK_event.3.a",
        "trigger": {},
        "effects": {
          "custom_effect_tooltip": "YGR_KOK_send_volunteers_to_russians_tt",
          "add_war_support": 0.05,
          "add_command_power": 25,
          "army_experience": 25,
          "add_manpower": 25000,
          "army_funding_minimal_increase_low": true,
          "TNO_worsen_army_professionalism_low": true,
          "YGR": {
